<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδέκ-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>receiver</i>: in pl., <i>financial officials,</i>
			established by Cleisthenes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.162
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1321b33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>: also at Thasos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(8).608
			</span></i>; in Egypt, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ostr.</u>
					1217
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχύρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					43r
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				iii 8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.114
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῶν πολιτικῶν χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Jahresh.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			/<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Beibl.</u>
				255
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδεκ-τεύω</span></b> , <i>hold office of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδέκτης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(8).391
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				610
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thasos</span>).</div>
